    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Starships_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy</a></i></p><p><b>Emplacement Points:</b>&nbsp;0</p><p>Normally, only <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Cannons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blaster Cannons\">Blaster Cannons</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Laser_Cannons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Laser Cannons\">Laser Cannons</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Light_Ion_Cannons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Ion Cannons\">Light Ion Cannons</a> can be Point-Defense Weapons. Modifying a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_System\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon System\">Weapon System</a> to be Point-Defense costs 4000 credits per <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_System\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon System\">Weapon System</a> but has no <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Emplacement_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Emplacement Point\">Emplacement Point</a> requirement (Other than what is required to mount the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_System\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon System\">Weapon System</a> itself). A Point-Defense Weapon takes no penalty for attacking targets of smaller than Colossal size.</p>",
